# Key NAMES only. Never put a real value in this file: it is committed to git.
# Real values go in a file named .env in this same folder (git ignores it, and
# Claude Code is set to refuse to read it). The tools in this project read .env;
# Claude Code itself does not.
# One line per key, name then an equals sign, nothing after it. Examples:
EMAIL_SERVICE_API_KEY=
CRM_API_KEY=
